<title>GERMANY: Turbina to head Moscow office of Cologne Re.</title>
<headline>Turbina to head Moscow office of Cologne Re.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dr Capitolina Turbina, former deputy head of the insurance supervisory office of the Russian Federation, has been appointed as head of the Moscow office by Cologne Re, the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Her predecessor as head of Cologne Re's office, Dr Peter Muller, will join Munich Re as chief of its Moscow operation, replacing Valery Tarasov who left the German reinsurer, a Munich Re spokesman confirmed.</p>
<p>Cologne Re is controlled by US insurance giant General Re.</p>
<p>--Reuters Insurance News +44 171 542 2770</p>
</text>
